    "en": [
      "The postcard features a sepia-toned portrait of a man in 19th-century attire, wearing a fur-collared coat and a cravat. Below the image, the name 'Robert Schumann (1810-1856)' is printed, along with the French words 'Compositeur et Pianiste' (Composer and Pianist). There are also numbers and publisher marks, including 'A.N. Paris' and '142'."
